    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE HUNTED: SHADOWS OF DESPAIR</strong>:<br>The shadows awaken in the very first chapter of the series to unveil hidden truths and mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Alex Walker</i> our Paranormal Investigator and Psychic Medium will take you on a live investigation that he has taken on for a long missing persons case which has been left un explained and unsolved by Police Detectives for many years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the buildings, forests and grave yards to gather as much information as possible to solve the case. But be cautious not everything is as it seems.</p>",
